msgid ""
"When managing a fleet with a high number of drones, the battery status data."
" Data about the status of the individual cells as well as logging data of "
"each individual flight can be uploaded using a wifi-capable interfacing "
"hardware that can be integrated in the chargers."
msgstr "在管理大型无人机队时，可将电池状态数据以及各次飞行中单个电芯的状态和日志数据通过集成在充电器中的 Wi-Fi 接口硬件上传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerotate-dronecan-battery.rst:36
#: 3b13af217d834e5baa981d9871078d34 469624e501444d2dbfdc681260da88c0
