#: db80c4e23ca94c5fa1c0d81527819ce6
msgid ""
"When a software update is rolled out, you can easily update the batteries "
"using the DroneCAN GUI Tool."
msgstr "发布软件更新时，可使用 DroneCAN GUI 工具轻松更新电池固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerotate-dronecan-battery.rst:39
#: 737b462870214e7b80345d727fafaa48 908acb9604e140169c6ffc9bfec52977
#: 939fd47755ee4772a33b60d7d0ff6316 eb080e08021b41bbaddb269417652090
#: f87f0e43aaa64759bde03468b22e4787
