msgstr "连接与配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerotate-dronecan-battery.rst:41
#: 29eafbe9220c4d1cadde7e14dc9d7142 3d0b423a1909434fb5b134739d52ca3f
#: 64ca4fdbb7b946e295c6e3586b4fa296 abcf5912d91d439fbcb1f36f1669cbf3
#: c1cc1d96c1f44d0eb65c9e6aebadc60e
msgid ""
"The aeroPAX batteries come with a standard adapter to attach to your drone. "
"The adapter comes with standard JST-GH plugs to connect to one of the CAN "
"buses. Current distribution can be done directly on the adapter board. The "
"adapters are customizable, if there is the need, you can contact "
"info@aerotate.de."
msgstr ""
"aeroPAX 电池配有标准适配器，可安装至无人机上。适配器附带标准 JST-GH 插头，用于连接其中一路 CAN "
"总线。电流分配可直接在适配板上进行。适配器可定制，如有需要请联系 info@aerotate.de。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerotate-dronecan-battery.rst:43
#: 449d1932d43c4e5fac0e862837d6246d 834d0e04dfc64ddd9c1243e5a2547bb6
#: 9b7a7d6d8a204830be8606958b6e54b3 b73197861a07465a9ca3fdcb026c0cdd
#: e0115ec5629b4b7e8d6360a94a080371
msgid ""
"To setup the aeroPAX Smart Battery in Mission Planer for DroneCAN, go to "
"Config/Tuning Full Parameter List, then search for “BATT” or scroll down to "
":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>`."
msgstr ""
"要在 Mission Planner 中为 DroneCAN 设置 aeroPAX 智能电池，请进入 Config/Tuning "
"完整参数列表，搜索「BATT」或向下滚动至 :ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerotate-dronecan-battery.rst:49
#: 028e687e5f95442aa6c14079a0f7beee 42ea0e90eb9e4faea91b583ac135255c
#: 50941569921740e899aa182d66993469 5f9f1cd8869d4323a94e24014e8211b3
#: b05a706bc3554650a4c7c129d230e092
msgid ""
"Connect to the autopilot with a ground station and set the following "
"parameters and then reboot the autopilot"
msgstr "使用地面站连接飞控，设置以下参数后重启飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerotate-dronecan-battery.rst:51
#: 013d3cba86954dfda91e3773aba062cc 3ea586e495c4431a9108930d6f84a120
#: 54327e7db0d34c90bcdacf41b3452991 6346bf58825e4c92a083742c061cc527
#: c359fb2b3071431eb6109c003cdaff9e
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER<CAN_P1_DRIVER>` to 1 (First Driver) or "
":ref:`CAN_P2_DRIVER<CAN_P2_DRIVER>` to 1 (Second Driver) for second CAN port"
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER<CAN_P1_DRIVER>` 设为 1（第一驱动器）或将 "
":ref:`CAN_P2_DRIVER<CAN_P2_DRIVER>` 设为 1（第二驱动器，用于第二路 CAN 接口）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerotate-dronecan-battery.rst:52
#: 145eb8c5ec4348ae9724c7d41a1bc596 22241d627556485598dce9eec7512d3a
#: 8133a02a21a045db8f95e72eae1a380a 958326e8a5b1437a9bc98b1e387b88c2
#: e9307f4d835544248c6d3ddc8439e7db
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`CAN_D1_PROTOCOL<CAN_D1_PROTOCOL>` to 1 (DroneCAN) or "
":ref:`CAN_D2_PROTOCOL<CAN_D2_PROTOCOL>` to 1 for second CAN port"
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`CAN_D1_PROTOCOL<CAN_D1_PROTOCOL>` 设为 1（DroneCAN）或将 "
":ref:`CAN_D2_PROTOCOL<CAN_D2_PROTOCOL>` 设为 1（用于第二路 CAN 接口）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerotate-dronecan-battery.rst:53
#: 104d61e1894f4e53b4deade158e6cbf1 4ba3b4f90bc64a95ba9d1e8e9f7ab7ad
#: c6f7d52761a1420d973f0bcaf8b15c20 d5366a1b1cb144f1bfbf7d7ffea19367
#: f33ee0386f3e4a9ea9f94ea2e8e4de98
msgid "Set :ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` to 8 (DroneCAN)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` 设置为 8（DroneCAN）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerotate-dronecan-battery.rst:54
#: 9169e4e3c4424608bed483ced69afd31 a570a7911dfc4954950905162ed19869
#: afba43c9046c4cb59d4d091392ea22f2 bc14674f55a24ed5b0e25b60ed630151
#: fdda8e27d50943c18e1d9fb05a6f4e47
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`BATT_SERIAL_NUM<BATT_SERIAL_NUM>` to the address you have set at "
"the battery adapter. On each battery adapter, 4 bits can be set to encode "
"this field resulting in 16 possible addresses, where addresses 0 and 15 are "
"reserved and cannot be used. The DroneCAN parameter is battery_id."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`BATT_SERIAL_NUM<BATT_SERIAL_NUM>` 设置为您在电池适配器上设定的地址。每个电池适配器可设置 4 "
"位来编码该字段，共有 16 个可用地址，其中地址 0 和 15 为保留地址，不可使用。DroneCAN 参数名为 battery_id。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerotate-dronecan-battery.rst:56
#: 06e72d16c43a47c0adfda02f7ce2f523 3d3f545e80f943e8b6d28876d3c4d801
#: 61e342b7b04e4d39a00b775a8ef7f218 a2bf1edd016f4e71b5169c1194bd1cbe
#: c41a2719eb8b48bbb7601bfbe75c3da3
msgid ""
"The aeroPAX batteries can be setup in parallel and series, but max 2 in "
"series. For parallel setups, a protected output is strongly recommended. It "
"enables hot-swap-ability and protects against user errors. For parallel "
"setups an additional battery monitor can be added as "
":ref:`BATT_SUM_MASK<BATT_SUM_MASK>`, this will sum up the currents and "
"average the voltages, for a better overview."
msgstr ""
"aeroPAX 电池可并联或串联使用，但串联最多 2 "
"节。对于并联配置，强烈建议使用带保护输出，以支持热插拔功能并防止用户误操作。对于并联配置，可添加一个额外的电池监控器作为 "
":ref:`BATT_SUM_MASK<BATT_SUM_MASK>`，这将汇总各路电流并对电压取平均值，以便获得更好的整体概览。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerotate-dronecan-battery.rst:60
#: 1ec78182512e4f239203018f2b1ca16b 251f73c390444828aef7547bd5f7890f
#: 90fed5508d744fe5bf56094633fceb84 99679e4f0b2541b6be366eaea5bb93cb
#: a37e5767f56f4638a7b261b0e96bb90b
msgid "Safety"
msgstr "安全"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerotate-dronecan-battery.rst:62
#: 180614489c614d67bf6539a1b2be25f9 1c0f13223da34d63ba7ebe542f7749bc
#: 54e7211a5deb4fabbeaccc50831bb423 bf615a87f5c442c3a5c26397dab9b228
#: ec465bbe99cc4b8bb842531760cfbb79
msgid ""
"Using Mission Planner's preflight checklist can enhance your safety, by "
"checking that the state of charge (SOC) is above a specific limit."
msgstr "使用 Mission Planner 的飞前检查清单，通过检查荷电状态（SOC）是否高于特定限值，可有效提升安全性。"
